\newlabel{tab:fpc}{{2}{6}{Missing mass of the finite corpus by sampling fraction, mean over eight Qwen3 corpora and three radii (the 25th, 50th and 75th percentiles of the pilot's nearest neighbour distances). The last column is the mean absolute error of the corrected estimate}{table.caption.3}{}}
